vox-monster-voice/models/

# Logs and system
*.log
nohup.out
.cline/
.git-corrupted-bak*/

# Jarvis conversation DB snapshots. DATA, not code — and this repo is PUBLIC.
# They were briefly committed here on 2026-09-18 and purged from history.
jarvis-db-backups/

# Jarvis Google index databases — DATA, not code, and this repo is PUBLIC.
# They cover four accounts (medical / military / family health) under a
# local-only inference rule. A stray git-backup.service — installed 2026-05-27,
# retired 2026-09-24 — ran `git add .` on a 30s loop and committed them 937
# times, refilling a repo that had already been purged on 2026-09-18
# (396 GB -> 60 MB on the second purge). The monthly replacement belongs in
# Google Drive, not git: see jarvis-google-backup.timer -> backup-to-drive.sh.
# Never track these again.
cerebro-mirror/jarvis/google/*.db*
cerebro-mirror/jarvis/google/accounts/

# Model weights are NOT code: 104 GB of history and 99.9% of the repo size.
# They are re-downloadable from HuggingFace — keep the setup scripts and the
# model ids, never the weights. See services/*/weights/.
services/*/weights/
services/*/_*.pth

# Secrets never enter this repo. brain.env was pulled here by the mirror script
# and sat in the unpushed commits — one working push from publishing a live
# OpenRouter key. The mirror script now excludes it and fails loudly if any
# secret-shaped value reappears.
.env
*.env
brain.env
*credential*
*secret*
*.key
*.pem
client.json
